    <string name="a11y_intro">We believe everyone deserves the right to read. Adjust visibility, speech rate, or contrast so INTENT adapts to your pace, rather than the other way around. May technology bring warmth as well as speed.</string>
    <string name="widget_preview_title">Discover a new world through reading</string>
    <string name="widget_preview_second">Stories worth reading today</string>
    <string name="widget_preview_source">Sample source</string>
    <string name="widget_preview_note">Illustrative previews; your widgets show articles from your subscriptions.</string>
    <string name="ui_intro">Your reading space should suit your senses. From the look of the icon and the feel of the type to the balance of light and dark, shape your own island of calm in whatever way feels most comfortable.</string>
    <string name="ai_intro">We believe in transparent Ai collaboration. Your API key is stored encrypted only on your device, and reading content connects directly to your chosen provider without passing through an intermediary server. Intelligence is here to help; privacy and security remain yours to protect.</string>
    <string name="ai_feature_quote">Daily Quote</string>
    <string name="ai_feature_quote_desc">A cloud LLM selects quotes that may be of higher quality than those chosen by the local algorithm. When enabled, it tries once a day when candidate article text is available on the home page. Only excerpts verified in the source are shown; offline quotes remain on failure. Extracting again calls the service again.</string>
    <string name="ai_feature_diet">Information Diet Report</string>
    <string name="ai_feature_diet_desc">Understand the shape of your reading\nThis local-data analysis tool helps you assess your information intake objectively.</string>
